Thank you for supporting our game. The description for this updated are:

**Updates**
-add Help Menu;
-add Chinese achievements and descriptions;
-fix parts of the problem that the girl might disappear for a while.

**What will be updated next**
-improve play's operation experience;
-add CG gallery;
-add hotkey changing function;
-add more achievements related to hidden CG and map events;


Once again, we express our deep apologies for the bugs and late updates of our game. At the same time, thank you all for your support.
The Early Access status of "Stalker" will be continued for a while. In addition, the NetBit @UW production team will continue to improve the game, and prepare to add more achievements, and other new contents.
Please look forward to it.


NetBit @UW
7.28.2020
